#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2119
msgid "The map seats the players and runs the game."
msgstr "マップがプレイヤーを配置してゲームを進めます。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2121
msgid "Your seat"
